 "final_message": "Intent to proceed is recorded and both underwriting conditions are answered. Application BHL-26001 at Brightpath Home Lending is now \"In underwriting\".\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** The rate is 7.25% (limit 7.5%). The total monthly payment is $3,485.58 (limit $3,600). Closing costs are $13,200 (limit $14,500). All three are within your limits, so I signed the intent to proceed with both your names.\n- **Documents:** I uploaded 12 files and submitted them to underwriting. They are the last 2 statements for each of your four personal accounts and the last 2 payslips for each of you. The Northgate business account was not included.\n- **Deposit condition:** Brightpath asked about the $8,000 mobile check deposit on 09/03 into Sam's Juniper checking. I told them it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan, as Sam and Nadia told me.\n- **W-2 condition:** I attached both 2025 W-2s.\n\nBrightpath's response page shows no further open conditions.",
